      "content": "SP 90 NW                   CHARTRIDGE           BANK GREEN 2/8                                             Bank Farm House - -                                                II House.  C17 altered.  Timber framed, cased in brick C18 and C19. Old tiled roof half hipped at south end, central chimney of old bricks, two old gabled dormers on east side, three modern dormers on west. One storey and attic.  Modern casements irregularly spaced on east side with one 3-light to left having segmental arched head.  Modern lean-to glazed porch on right.  Interior:  Two large inglenooks to central chimney.  Exposed timber framing including curved windbraces in roof. Listing NGR: SP9334305644"
    }
